flowchart TD
    Start([Start])
    OpenPage[User opens Payment / Expense page]
    GetWallet[System retrieves user's wallet]
    CheckStatus{Is wallet ACTIVE?}

    ErrorStatus[Display wallet status error]

    InputData[User enters amount, category, and optional description]
    InputPIN[User enters transaction PIN]
    Submit[User submits payment request]

    ValidateInput{Are all input fields valid?}
    ErrorInput[Display input validation error]

    VerifyPIN[System verifies transaction PIN]
    PINValid{Is transaction PIN correct?}
    ErrorPIN[Display invalid transaction PIN]

    CheckBalance{Is wallet balance sufficient?}
    ErrorBalance[Display insufficient balance]

    BeginTransaction[Begin database transaction]
    LockWallet[Lock user's wallet]
    RecheckBalance[System rechecks wallet balance]
    BalanceValid{Is balance still sufficient?}

    GenerateReference[System generates unique transaction reference]
    DeductBalance[System deducts payment amount from wallet]
    CreateTransaction[System creates PAYMENT transaction record]
    SaveData[(Save wallet and transaction data)]
    Commit[Commit database transaction]

    Success[Display payment success and updated balance]

    Rollback[Rollback database transaction]
    ErrorSystem[Display payment failure message]

    End([End])

    Start --> OpenPage
    OpenPage --> GetWallet
    GetWallet --> CheckStatus

    CheckStatus -- No --> ErrorStatus
    ErrorStatus --> End

    CheckStatus -- Yes --> InputData
    InputData --> InputPIN
    InputPIN --> Submit
    Submit --> ValidateInput

    ValidateInput -- No --> ErrorInput
    ErrorInput --> InputData

    ValidateInput -- Yes --> VerifyPIN
    VerifyPIN --> PINValid

    PINValid -- No --> ErrorPIN
    ErrorPIN --> InputPIN

    PINValid -- Yes --> CheckBalance

    CheckBalance -- No --> ErrorBalance
    ErrorBalance --> End

    CheckBalance -- Yes --> BeginTransaction
    BeginTransaction --> LockWallet
    LockWallet --> RecheckBalance
    RecheckBalance --> BalanceValid

    BalanceValid -- No --> Rollback
    BalanceValid -- Yes --> GenerateReference

    GenerateReference --> DeductBalance
    DeductBalance --> CreateTransaction
    CreateTransaction --> SaveData
    SaveData --> Commit

    Commit --> Success
    Success --> End

    LockWallet -. Database error .-> Rollback
    DeductBalance -. Database error .-> Rollback
    CreateTransaction -. Database error .-> Rollback
    SaveData -. Database error .-> Rollback

    Rollback --> ErrorSystem
    ErrorSystem --> End